# ── project-specific ──
# Source archives for the models in OBJECTS/ — the extracted assets are what the
# game loads, so the zips are redundant weight in the repo. Delete this line if
# you would rather keep the originals under version control.
ZIPPED/

# Scratch work and local playtest recordings
scratch/
*.gif.tmp

# Knowledge-graph output from `/graphify` — ~1.4 MB of derived data (graph.json,
# graph.html, the extraction cache) rebuilt from source on demand. The manifest
# and cache inside it are machine-local paths, so committing it would fight with
# anyone else's copy rather than help them.
graphify-out/
